 "summary": "Three single Schottky rectifiers in the SOD-323 surface-mount package, rated 1.0 A average forward current and differing in reverse voltage: 20 V (B5817WS), 30 V (B5818WS) and 40 V (B5819WS). Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling and reverse-polarity protection. B5819WS is the 40 V part, with 0.6 V maximum forward drop at 1 A.",
